<h1>Crate Digger V2</h1>

<p>
  Welcome to Crate Digger V2, a vinyl collection tracker where you can
  browse records, artists, and genres while building your own collection.
</p>

<% if current_user %>
  <h2>Welcome, <%= current_user.username %>!</h2>

  <p>
    Ready to keep digging? View your personal collection or explore the
    record database below.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "View My Collection", collection_entries_path %>
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= button_to "Log Out", logout_path, method: :delete %>
  </p>
<% else %>
  <h2>Start Your Collection</h2>

  <p>
    Create an account to save records to your personal collection.
    Already have an account? Log in to continue where you left off.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Sign Up", signup_path %>
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Log In", login_path %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<h2>Explore the Database</h2>

<p>
  Browse the music currently stored in Crate Digger.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Records", records_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Artists", artists_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse Genres", genres_path %>
</p>

<h2>Contribute</h2>

<p>
  Don't see what you're looking for? Add new music information to the database.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Add New Record", new_record_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Add New Artist", new_artist_path %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Add New Genre", new_genre_path %>
</p>
